Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:28.30,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, let's introduce our guest for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:32.72,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's Kei Hayashi, who wrote the song "Going On as We Are" for Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.00,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Welcome to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:35.28,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:36.32,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I'm Kei Hayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.28,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:41.00,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,We're happy to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:43.24,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Alright, let me give a quick introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:48.98,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Kei Hayashi began his band activities as a vocalist and guitarist in 2008,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:52.76,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and started posting original Vocaloid songs around the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:57.22,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,His songs "Pierrot", "Hello, Worker", and "Hashire" have all reached a million views,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:13:03.20,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and in 2023, Leo/need and Megurine Luka's cover of "Hello, Worker" was released.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:08.94,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,With a motto of "making music that treasures words", he not only produces music,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:13.68,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,but also has been expanding his work as a lyricist, composer, and arranger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:17.09,Yuki Nakashima,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,working on songs for other artists, as well as anime and games themes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:17.61,Ai Shimizu,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:22.40,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Kei-san, you've been active in the Vocaloid scene for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:25.84,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,but is appearing on a program like this quite rare for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.57,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's almost never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:28.68,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:32.75,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll get to hear some very precious stories today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:34.61,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.12,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.20,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,No pressure or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:37.72,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:39.60,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Well then, first,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:45.08,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,to help you relax, I'll ask about your favorite plum dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.64,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,First off, do you like plums?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.28,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Oh, I like them well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:49.87,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:50.76,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,How do you like to eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:52.88,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,On top of rice, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:55.72,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I really love honey-pickled plums.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:56.64,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:57.23,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:59.42,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,If you'd said you didn't like them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.28,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I was almost going to ask you to step out of Wakayama Prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:03.76,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:07.80,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,On that note, let's all start talking about Vocaloid music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:12.86,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I'd like to dive into the Sekai of Vocalo Music together with Kei Hayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.72,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Once again, it's a pleasure to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:15.36,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,The pleasure is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:15.91,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Glad to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:50.00,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,All right, let's move on to our next corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:53.16,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's time for the guest Q&A segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:55.92,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,The moment you've\Nall been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:59.99,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,We're going to dive into the making of\NLeo/need's "Going On as We Are",
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:05.40,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,getting the full inside story directly from songwriter Kei Hayashi himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:09.78,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So, for our first question,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:17.14,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,how did you decide on the title "Going On as We Are"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:20.88,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Well, when I first received this song request from ProSeka,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:25.24,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,they sent over a brief, or rather, a project proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:27.85,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,So I read through that brief,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.85,0:22:30.44,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,and in it, I kept seeing the key phrase;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:34.56,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,"let's keep going on as we are."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.53,0:22:34.56,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.56,0:22:35.58,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,When I read that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:40.44,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I thought, "This would work perfectly as the title and in the lyrics,"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:45.48,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,so I decided to just borrow it and make it the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:46.80,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:51.01,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,So you established the title firmly based on the story and the brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:51.69,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:57.22,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,And from there, you began designing the sound and the lyrics?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.22,0:22:58.24,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:01.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Then, please tell us about the sound first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:04.41,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Regarding the sound, since it's a Leo/need song,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:07.50,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I really wanted to capture that band-like feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:08.98,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,and that youthful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.98,0:23:09.72,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Youthful spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:13.79,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That was something I wanted to bring out from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:16.96,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,So that's why for the arrangement and the instruments,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:20.20,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I kept the overdubbing to a minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.20,0:23:24.42,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Basically, I wanted it to feel like just drums, bass, piano, and two guitars.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:27.67,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Just a simple five-person ensemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:33.90,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I decided on a simple band sound that works as a five-piece ensemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:37.06,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I really wanted to bring out that band-like feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.62,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,So, instead of using MIDI programming,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.62,0:23:43.36,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I asked actual musicians to record the parts as a live performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:45.91,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That's what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:50.04,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,When I was doing the vocal recording,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:52.02,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Kei-san actually came to the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:57.16,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,We talked then, and regarding the instrumentalists...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.50,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:24:03.10,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,You mentioned that even though the parts are played by high schoolers,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:06.36,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,you didn't want to make them easy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:07.60,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:11.68,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,That made me so happy. It was like... how do I say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:12.36,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,It was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:15.16,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,A challenge to the people who post instrumental covers,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.16,0:24:17.40,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,like, "Let's see if you can play this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.40,0:24:21.72,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,You said something like you wanted to show them that spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.72,0:24:25.40,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Hearing that you put those thoughts into it made me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:29.22,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,It made me feel like we were all creating this together,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:31.46,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,and that really came through in the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.46,0:24:34.20,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I had so much fun listening to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:36.35,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,And I was truly happy with how it turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.35,0:24:37.04,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:37.94,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I'm so moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:39.93,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So it was created with that level
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.93,0:24:42.64,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,of dedication and thought behind the request.
Comment: 0,0:24:42.64,0:24:44.32,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,,0,0,0,,~~~~~~~~~~~~QUESTION 2~~~~~~~~~~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:47.48,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Next, please tell us about the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:51.16,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Sure. I'm quite particular about lyrics, so I might end up talking for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.36,0:24:51.96,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:53.84,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,That's exactly what this segment is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.95,0:24:54.45,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:24:58.24,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Well, I might be a bit of a rare type,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:02.18,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,but when I write songs, I usually start with the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.18,0:25:04.77,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Most people start with the melody,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.77,0:25:07.54,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,but I start with a rough outline of the lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:08.98,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,and then add the melody to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:11.84,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Then I'll refine the lyrics to fit the melody,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:13.06,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,but that's how I usually go about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.06,0:25:16.83,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,So for this song, I also started by thinking about the lyrics first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:22.89,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,When it comes to my policy or motto for writing lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:25.48,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,even when it's a song for another artist to sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:32.80,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,my core rule is never to write lyrics I don't believe in,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.80,0:25:36.57,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,that go against my philosophy, or that feel like hollow lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:42.84,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,So I started by looking for a shared philosophy and story
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.84,0:25:46.68,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,between Leo/need and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:50.74,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I looked at how Leo/need has hesitated and stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:57.52,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,yet ultimately chose to keep making music together,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.52,0:26:00.30,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,and I connected that with my own journey
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.78,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,of continuing music to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.78,0:26:08.60,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I poured my own feelings into the lyrics as I wrote them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.12,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That was my starting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.21,0:26:09.65,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,That's so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.67,0:26:10.17,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.76,0:26:11.92,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.44,0:26:17.58,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,After looking at their story, the first major theme that came to mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.58,0:26:23.63,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,was that I wanted to make "dreams" the core theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.65,0:26:24.15,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.28,0:26:29.58,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,There are plenty of songs in the world about dreams, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.58,0:26:35.14,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Many songs talk about how wonderful it is to chase your dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.14,0:26:37.20,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,or encourage you to work hard toward them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:40.06,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,But I've lived for about 40 years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:44.48,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,and I've had dreams that didn't come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.04,0:26:48.88,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I've also seen many friends whose dreams were broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:51.51,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,If I just pushed some cookie-cutter message,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.51,0:26:55.68,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,like, "Your dreams will come true if you don't give up,"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:58.68,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,it'd feel fake. It'd feel like I'm just repeating hollow platitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:01.66,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I wanted to convey a different kind of theme,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:05.79,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,or rather, message, in my song.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.79,0:27:10.46,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,And on the other hand, when I thought about my own journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.41,0:27:17.44,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,it's not like there was this grand dream or purpose for pursuing music.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.44,0:27:22.32,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Even when things were unpleasant, I just felt like music was fun, 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:24.98,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,or at the very least, I couldn't really find anything else I liked as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.98,0:27:29.30,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I've continued for small, ordinary reasons like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.30,0:27:32.02,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That's how I reached where I am today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:35.92,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That's why if I were to write a song about dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:39.92,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I didn't want it to be a story about someone just chasing a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.92,0:27:43.38,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,but a story about someone who didn't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.79,0:27:47.00,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Rather than how wonderful it is to achieve a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:49.06,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I wanted a song that celebrates the stubborn beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.06,0:27:50.64,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,of refusing to let go of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.64,0:27:54.72,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That was my intent for the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:28:03.30,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,That feels so much more real. It really hits home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.30,0:28:05.27,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's not exactly an escape, but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:10.70,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,like a new perspective that says, "It's okay to feel this way."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.70,0:28:12.70,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Hearing the intention behind your lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:14.70,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I really feel this song can support people,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.70,0:28:16.70,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,by giving them a whole new perspective they can lean on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:20.19,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's like a lucky charm. When something happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.19,0:28:23.32,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,you feel like listening to this song again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:26.00,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's such a warm song.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:28.86,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Nakashima-san, listening to this track...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.86,0:28:30.60,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,what were some of your favorite parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.97,0:28:31.58,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.58,0:28:34.08,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Your signature style is all over this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:39.96,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I've actually been listening to your music since I was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:42.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,We have quite a few staff members like that here today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:46.16,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,No, but seriously, I love "dialogue" so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.04,0:28:50.36,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I used to sing it at karaoke all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.36,0:28:53.18,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,So when Leo/need got to cover "Hello, Worker"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.18,0:28:55.00,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,, I was like, "Wait, really?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:29:02.60,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I never imagined I'd get an original song written for Shiho,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:07.12,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,so I personally felt like it was fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.12,0:29:08.16,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,In my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.16,0:29:12.04,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,So, when I first heard this song, how should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.04,0:29:17.32,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Even for Shiho, it's so positive and bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:23.80,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,It's bright, yet it still has a strong band sound
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.80,0:29:29.06,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,that puts her drive to stay true to her convictions front and center.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.06,0:29:34.20,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,It felt like a first for her, or rather, a new side of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.20,0:29:37.80,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,The lyrics resonated with me so naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.80,0:29:41.90,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Rather than one favorite part, I love it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.96,0:29:42.56,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.16,0:29:45.92,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Thank you for such a wonderful song.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.32,0:29:49.08,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It really is a lovely, positive song that feels softer
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:51.64,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,than the impression Shiho has given off until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.64,0:29:54.72,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It's very uplifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.04,0:29:55.82,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.82,0:29:57.52,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,You don't often see Shiho...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.92,0:30:01.36,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,smiling quite this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.84,0:30:05.68,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,She smiles sometimes, but it's usually a cool sort of smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.68,0:30:08.82,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,This time, her love for music is just radiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.82,0:30:11.20,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,That feeling of wanting to keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:14.18,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,with everyone in Leo/need is so prominent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.18,0:30:17.76,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,here, which is rare and makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:21.17,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Through the events, I'm so glad Shiho's hard work paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:22.84,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,It makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.84,0:30:25.44,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Knowing what she's been through makes that smile even more special.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.68,0:30:29.86,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Actually, in the chronological order of the event stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.86,0:30:32.42,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Shiho was the only one being super positive...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.42,0:30:36.03,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,right when storm clouds were starting to gather
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.03,0:30:37.72,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,for the other members.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.72,0:30:40.20,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,When the song came out, people were like,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.20,0:30:43.86,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,"Shiho's smiling the whole time?is she okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.86,0:30:50.86,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I think some fans were commenting, "What's going to happen next?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.86,0:30:55.42,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,But even if you don't know Shiho's story, how should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.42,0:30:59.30,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I feel like this song can really support your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.30,0:31:03.80,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,If you have any friends around you who are struggling a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.80,0:31:06.44,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I'd love for you to recommend it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.95,0:31:07.52,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.52,0:31:09.40,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I think it's a song that can support you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.40,0:31:11.32,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,at so many different points in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.44,0:31:17.26,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Kei Hayashi-san, you clearly place a lot of importance on your lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.26,0:31:20.90,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and I heard you have a favorite phrase from this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.90,0:31:22.72,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Could you tell us about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.80,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,As for my favorite part of this song...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.40,0:31:27.02,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,It's the phrase after the second chorus:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.02,0:31:31.84,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,"Even after a rain with no rainbow, seeds still sprout in the soil."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:35.34,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,That's the line I'm most fond of, or rather, the one
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:37.02,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I feel most confident in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:39.61,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,You know, you often hear people say things
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.61,0:31:42.64,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,like "there's a rainbow after every rain," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:46.72,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,But a rainbow doesn't always appear after it rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:48.72,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,It's been raining a lot lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.72,0:31:51.07,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,and I often find myself thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.07,0:31:54.42,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,"I haven't actually seen a rainbow in a while."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.42,0:31:58.68,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee that success will always follow a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.32,0:32:03.02,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,But does that mean a rain that doesn't bring a rainbow has no value?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.02,0:32:07.96,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I don't want to believe that. There are sunny days, and there are rainy days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.96,0:32:11.20,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Even without a beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:14.36,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,easy-to-understand icon like a rainbow,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:16.92,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I think there's a beauty in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.92,0:32:22.22,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,our ordinary days and lives just quietly continue on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.22,0:32:26.40,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I want to believe there's something precious in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:32.66,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,I feel like I captured that feeling well in the phrase,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.66,0:32:39.60,Kei Hayashi - Shifted,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,"Even after a rain with no rainbow, seeds still sprout in the soil."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.79,0:32:40.29,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:45.36,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Everyone, we really need to take those words to heart when we listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.52,0:32:48.70,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Nakashima-san, do you have any memories
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.70,0:32:50.72,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,of how you approached the recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:51.76,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:33:01.56,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I sang in one of my brightest tones ever for Shiho,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:09.34,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,trying to put her love for music front and center,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:13.62,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,but since the song has such a sense of speed and freshness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.62,0:33:19.56,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I also kept some of Shiho's signature coolness to match the band sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.56,0:33:21.56,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.56,0:33:25.66,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I recorded it focusing on bringing out that sense
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.66,0:33:29.28,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,of fun and the things she loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:33.56,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Though I shouldn't be saying that myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.84,0:33:37.90,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Usually, whether she's speaking or singing,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.90,0:33:40.66,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Shiho tends to stay pretty cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.66,0:33:43.84,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,so it's rare to have a song
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.84,0:33:48.90,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,where you can actually picture her smiling just from her voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:51.44,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I hope I was able to convey that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.20,0:33:52.88,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,We can definitely feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.52,0:33:54.20,Yuki Nakashima - Shifted,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.95,0:33:55.45,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.36,0:34:03.20,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,I hope everyone enjoys the Virtual Singer version, the SEKAI version,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.20,0:34:07.12,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,and the various Another Vocal versions as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.00,0:34:09.13,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Kei Hayashi-san, thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.13,0:34:10.76,Ai Shimizu - Shifted,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,for sharing such wonderful stories with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:12.12,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.20,0:34:16.98,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now that you've had a chance to talk about your music in front of everyone—well,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.98,0:34:18.20,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,on stream— how are you feeling about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:18.84,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Looking back on today's segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.96,0:34:24.92,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Well, I was incredibly nervous, so I'm not sure if I managed to say everything I wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.92,0:34:28.16,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,But I hope that for the listeners who tuned in today,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.16,0:34:31.22,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,the song "Going On as We Are" and the game ProSeka
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.22,0:34:36.12,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,became just a little bit more fun and interesting than they were before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.12,0:34:36.84,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.20,0:34:38.40,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.92,0:34:42.72,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Nakashima-san, thank you for joining us today as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.84,0:34:44.40,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Thank you! It was a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.52,0:34:48.72,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Getting to hear such precious stories live... Sekai of Vocalo Music really is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:55.37,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Seriously, this is the only place you can hear these things, so I'm so glad this corner exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.39,0:34:55.89,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.36,0:34:59.08,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Kei Hayashi-san, I'm really looking forward to all your future work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.08,0:35:00.28,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.40,0:35:01.00,Kei Hayashi,Kei Hayashi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.24,0:35:02.54,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.54,0:35:05.08,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Now, the program is still going to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.92,0:35:09.12,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,To everyone who stayed with us until the end of this segment, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.72,0:35:14.60,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Starting from 8:05 PM, we'll be bringing you the latest news on ProSeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.60,0:35:16.84,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,So, we'll see you again shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.90,0:35:17.40,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.40,0:35:18.52,Yuki Nakashima,Yuki Nakashima,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:19.00,Ai Shimizu,Ai Shimizu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
